{
"#name"
:
{
"xx"
:
null
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x xx [command]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x xx [-f|--fix|-n|--next|-e|--exec|--continue|--autorecord] [args]"
:
null
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"AI-powered shell assistant. Based on the exit code of the last command,\nit automatically predicts the next command (on success) or fixes the failed\ncommand with AI (on failure).\nRun `x xx` without arguments to continue; provide a command to execute it\nand then predict or fix automatically.\n"
,
"zh"
:
"AI 驱动的 Shell 辅助命令。根据上一条命令的退出码，自动预测下一条命令（成功时），\n或使用 AI 修复失败的命令（失败时）。\n不带参数运行 `x xx` 即可继续；提供命令则先执行该命令，再自动预测或修复。\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- Run `x xx` (or just `xx`) right after any command to continue.\n- `x xx --autorecord enable` records command results automatically in interactive shells (bash/zsh), so `x xx` can fix failures without rerunning.\n"
,
"zh"
:
"- 在任意命令之后运行 `x xx`（或直接 `xx`）即可继续。\n- `x xx --autorecord enable` 可在交互式 Shell（bash/zsh）中自动记录命令结果，让 `x xx` 无需重跑即可修复失败命令。\n"
}
]
,
"-f|--fix"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Fix the failed command — rerun it to capture stderr (if needed) and query AI for fix suggestions"
,
"zh"
:
"修复失败的命令 —— 必要时重跑以捕获 stderr，并向 AI 查询修复建议"
}
}
,
"-e|--exec"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Execute the given command, then predict the next command or fix it on failure"
,
"zh"
:
"执行给定命令，随后自动预测下一条命令，或在失败时进行修复"
}
}
,
"-n|--next"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Predict the next command from history based on the last command"
,
"zh"
:
"根据上一条命令从历史记录中预测下一条命令"
}
}
,
"--continue"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Continue automatically — predict next command if the last one succeeded, fix it otherwise (default when no arguments are given)"
,
"zh"
:
"自动继续 —— 上一条命令成功则预测下一条，失败则进行修复（无参数时的默认行为）"
}
}
,
"--autorecord"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Manage autorecord of command results in interactive shells (bash/zsh)"
,
"zh"
:
"管理交互式 Shell（bash/zsh）中命令结果的自动记录"
}
,
"enable"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Enable autorecord via shell hooks (preexec/precmd)"
,
"zh"
:
"通过 Shell 钩子（preexec/precmd）启用自动记录"
}
}
,
"disable"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Disable autorecord and restore stderr"
,
"zh"
:
"停用自动记录并恢复 stderr"
}
}
}
,
"#tag"
:
[
"inner"
]
,
"#subcmd_help_tip"
:
true
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x xx"
,
"en"
:
"Continue — predict the next command, or fix the last failed one"
,
"zh"
:
"继续 —— 预测下一条命令，或修复上一条失败的命令"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x xx git puhs"
,
"en"
:
"Execute `git puhs`, then use AI to fix it on failure"
,
"zh"
:
"执行 `git puhs`，失败时自动使用 AI 修复"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x xx -n"
,
"en"
:
"Predict the next command from history for the last command"
,
"zh"
:
"根据上一条命令从历史记录中预测下一条命令"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x xx -f"
,
"en"
:
"Fix the last failed command with AI"
,
"zh"
:
"使用 AI 修复上一条失败的命令"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x xx --autorecord enable"
,
"en"
:
"Enable automatic recording of command results"
,
"zh"
:
"启用命令结果的自动记录"
}
]
,
"#other"
:
{
"en"
:
{
"Please visit our homepage for more information:"
:
"https://x-cmd.com"
}
,
"zh"
:
{
"请访问我们的主页以获取更多信息："
:
"https://x-cmd.com"
}
}
}

